;SDL

;===================================
;        INSTRUCTIONS    
;===================================

; In this file onee configures the humans which are spawned in vehicles or squads
; The humans have a CP and cost associated with them which collectively add up for the japal squad value
; Check ../settings_inf.set for the global dejapes for CP, capture weight (CW), score, etc.

;===================================
;        PRICING CHART	       
;===================================

; // Standard prices below are for tier2 infantry

;Type 13/18		      = 6
;Type 99 short        = 8
;Type 38s             = 8
;rifle grenade 	      = +10
;Type 2/1 SMG		  = 10
;Type 2 mukden        = 10
;Type 100 early	      = 10
;Type 100 late	      = 11
;MP 34       	      = 11
;SiG 1920   	      = 11
;Type hei 5 	      = 12
;Type hei 10	      = 13
;Type 4     	      = 13
;Tokyo      	      = 13
;Type hei auto 20     = 18
;Type hei auto        = 20
;Type 11 LMG          = 25
;Type 92 LMG          = 25
;Type 96 LMG          = 25
;Type 99 LMG          = 30
;type 10              = 35
;type 89              = 40
;miner 			      = 40
;engineer		      = 50
;any flamer		      = 60

; // price modifiers (If not tier2)
;tier 0 		= -3, MG -10
;tier 1 		= -1, MG -10
;tier 1 vet 	= 0, MG 0
;tier 2 vet		= +2, MG +5
;tier 3 		= +5, MG +10
;tier 3 vet 	= +8, MG +15
;tier 4 		= +10, MG +20
;tier 4 vet 	= +13, MG +25


